 r←Result payload
⍝ Receive a result posted by the ticket server's worker, keep it in Results, and print it
⍝ payload - namespace from the JSON body, e.g. {"ticket":17,"n":360,"factors":[2,2,2,3,3,5]}
 Results,←payload
 ⎕←'Result for ticket ',(⍕payload.ticket),': ',(⍕payload.n),' = ',¯1↓∊(⍕¨payload.factors),¨'×'
 r←'received'
